      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i noticed that when i was cleaning up the workspace after the last batch, i found some weird, tiny white flakes that looked like they might have come from the chocolate, but they ended up being just some stuff stuck in the cracks of the marble slab. i guess i'm just being paranoid. besides the temperature, is there anything else that might cause this kind of weird \"bloom\" to suddenly appear out of nowhere during storage?",
